  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這個模組為遊戲增添了可愛的小助手！它們可以幫助你攜帶物品，並與你並肩作戰。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">預設情況下，它們會生成在平原生物群落中。（你可以透過編輯 data -> biome tags 和 biome modifier 資料夾中的 JSON 檔案來修改此設定及其他生成設定。）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以用肉來馴服它們。如果它們已經被馴服，則可以用肉為它們治療。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以使用主手拿著骨頭點擊它們來改變其行為模式（跟隨你、隨機行走、坐下）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以透過潛行並手持物品點擊它們，將該物品裝備到它們的主手中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">或者透過潛行並空手點擊它們，即可收回它們手中的物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果你想開啟它們的物品欄，只需在不潛行的情況下空手點擊它們即可。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模組目前支援：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.1. x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.1. x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Neoforge 26.1. x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1264/661/638823264467017908.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><strong>若你需要 CurseForge 上其他版本的模組，請發送私人訊息給我。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong>在 X (Twitter) 上關注我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>本模組需要安裝 AQUARIUSLIBS 才能運作</strong></a></span></p>",
